{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsPowerShell枚举共享脚本。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：PowerShell Share Enumeration Script。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-windows.powershell*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsPowerShell枚举共享脚本","references":["https://www.advintel.io/post/hunting-for-corporate-insurance-policies-indicators-of-ransom-exfiltrations","https://thedfirreport.com/2022/04/04/stolen-images-campaign-ends-in-conti-ransomware/","https://github.com/atc-project/atc-data/blob/master/docs/Logging_Policies/LP_0109_windows_powershell_script_block_log.md"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"4c59cff1-b78a-41b8-a9f1-4231984d1fb6","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text:(\n    \"Invoke-ShareFinder\" or\n    \"Invoke-ShareFinderThreaded\" or\n    (\n      \"shi1_netname\" and\n      \"shi1_remark\"\n    ) or\n    (\n      \"NetShareEnum\" and\n    \"NetApiBufferFree\"\n    )\n  ) and not user.id : \"S-1-5-18\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsPowerShell枚举共享脚本\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清域、账号、网络或主机\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1135","name":"Network Share Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1135/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]},{"id":"T1106","name":"Native API","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1106/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1039","name":"Data from Network Shared Drive","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1039/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"version":117,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
